      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      70.75,
      483.68,
      534.57,
      501.83
    ],
    "text": "the refusal of the application for postponement made by the Attorney At Law of",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.600000381469727,
      13.891721725463867,
      14.027238845825195
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      70.77,
      507.19,
      528.6,
      525.33
    ],
    "text": "the Appellant. It is well settled law that when a party to a case has an attorney-at-",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.600000381469727,
      13.683144569396973
    ]
