    "bbox": [
      71.42,
      530.96,
      532.51,
      549.1
    ],
    "text": "law on record, it is the attorney-at-law on record alone, who must take steps, and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      71.64,
      554.47,
      532.99,
      572.62
    ],
    "text": "also whom the Court permits to take steps. It is a recognized principle in Court",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.600000381469727,
      13.683144569396973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      71.55,
      578.23,
      532.94,
      596.37
    ],
    "text": "proceedings that when there is an attorney-at-law appointed by a party, such party",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      71.71,
      601.99,
      532.98,
      620.13
    ],
    "text": "must take all steps in the case through such attorney-at-law. Further, the principle",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.08,
      625.5,
      533.45,
      643.65
    ],
    "text": "established in a court is that if a party is represented by an attorney-at-law such a",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.600000381469727,
      13.87952709197998
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.25,
      649.02,
      533.44,
      667.17
    ],
    "text": "party himself is not permitted to address Court. All the submissions of the party",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.600000381469727,
      14.161460876464844
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.21,
      672.79,
      467.93,
      690.93
    ],
    "text": "must be made through the Attorney-at-law who represents such a party.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      142.23,
      709.52,
      534.05,
      727.66
    ],
    "text": "In the light of the aforesaid circumstances it is my considered view",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.600000381469727,
      14.161460876464844
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.69,
      733.52,
      533.74,
      751.67
    ],
